WEBVTT

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:51.040
Tonight at 7:OO PM, the Clock Hill
Merchants Association presents...

00:01:51.150 --> 00:01:56.340
the Annual Street Fair on the
grounds of Tachibana Temple.

00:01:57.110 --> 00:01:59.390
Everyone, be sure to
visit the haunted house!

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:03.190
Tonight at 7:OO PM, the Clock Hill
Merchants Association presents...

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:07.940
the Annual Street Fair on the
grounds of Tachibana Temple.

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:17.330
Kentaro. You look
handsome in that kimono.

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:20.830
I made it myself.

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:22.270
Did you?

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:24.400
Took her forever, too!

00:02:25.020 --> 00:02:27.300
Hi!
To you too, lady.

00:02:27.650 --> 00:02:30.010
Aren't you Godai's friend--

00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:31.400
Sakamoto.

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:32.770
H-Hello.

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:36.610
You're Okiku, that
chick in the well, right?

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:37.650
You know the story?

00:02:37.860 --> 00:02:39.400
You're a pretty
sexy ghost.

00:02:39.830 --> 00:02:41.340
I'm scary!

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:44.710
You're not scared?

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:46.580
Of course not!

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:49.150
That's scary.

00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:09.340
And with this line
my masterpiece is complete.

00:03:09.990 --> 00:03:14.730
You got taste! But if you
do it this way, it looks better.

00:03:15.270 --> 00:03:17.960
It's almost time to open.
Are you almost finished?

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:21.580
One makeup job,
comin' up!

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:38.780
Guess I'm not putting
enough into it--

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:44.020
Yotsuya! He was
supposed to be a cat!

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:45.990
Indeed, I am chagrined.

00:03:46.230 --> 00:03:51.780
As Godai sat before me, I could
only feel this was most fitting.

00:03:53.110 --> 00:04:00.020
I was guided by fate. My
passion produced this result.

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:01.530
--It's HIM!
--Ain't it!?

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:12.650
Ma, don't drink too much.
You'll embarrass me again.

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:21.760
You let them do anything! Didn't
you think something was up?

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:26.250
I-I had a feeling, but--

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:28.350
So I was thinkin'--

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:30.720
Go easy on it, Ma!

00:04:31.010 --> 00:04:31.720
Stay still.

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:41.310
Close your eyes.

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:43.470
Y-Yeah.

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:48.400
Godai, close your eyes.

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:50.670
Okay.

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:54.260
Kyoko? It's about time
to get in the well.

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:55.690
Coming!

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:04.290
The manager's chubby hands--

00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:10.140
If only we could
always be like this.

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:16.340
"Chubby"?

00:05:23.150 --> 00:05:24.140
W-When did you--

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:26.720
Stay still!

00:05:27.270 --> 00:05:28.960
You smell like a bottle!

00:05:29.370 --> 00:05:30.700
Stop squirmin'!

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:41.130
Where's that well?

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:04.580
Oh, hello!

00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:10.260
Where was the dry well?

00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:13.060
T-The dry well?

00:06:13.380 --> 00:06:16.100
It's down the
path on the right.

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:18.030
Thank you!

00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:22.640
Kuroda?

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:26.410
I practiced that
for three months!

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:30.520
Three whole months--

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:34.480
And it was great!
You put everything into it!

00:06:34.590 --> 00:06:36.850
Cheer up and
try it again!

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:40.950
Yeah, try again!

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:43.270
Here's your nail!

00:06:44.030 --> 00:06:46.460
Go--dai!

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:50.370
I-It's you, Master!

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:53.770
That costume is you!
You don't need makeup, huh?

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:56.750
Have you seen
the manager?

00:06:57.520 --> 00:06:59.210
She went to the
well a while back.

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:01.320
She's not here.

00:07:15.730 --> 00:07:17.280
This must be it.

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:19.980
"Dry well"?

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:23.460
There's an actual
dry well by the exit.

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:27.710
It's pretty deep and dangerous,
so we built this instead.

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:30.310
And does the
manager know this?

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:33.210
I left a message for her.

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:34.480
With who?

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:40.410
Yotsuya.

00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:48.200
Leave a message with Yotsuya,
and you know it'll go wrong!

00:07:58.540 --> 00:07:59.200
Stuff it!

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:11.410
Hey, you were fine!
You put your heart into it!

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:13.830
You were scary!
Nothing scarier!

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:15.280
No! It's a
MONSTER!!

00:08:16.590 --> 00:08:17.710
C'mon, man!

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:23.090
Manager!

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:25.170
A curse on you--

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:28.020
Forget the curse!
Are you all right?

00:08:28.380 --> 00:08:28.850
Yes.

00:08:29.270 --> 00:08:33.400
You weren't supposed to be here.
There's a fake well back there.

00:08:33.810 --> 00:08:36.040
Really?
That explains it.

00:08:36.890 --> 00:08:41.280
People would have to want to
look in for me to scare them.

00:08:42.860 --> 00:08:44.980
I'm surprised you got
down there at all.

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:46.810
I managed--

00:08:47.100 --> 00:08:48.550
Here.
I'll pull you up.

00:08:48.820 --> 00:08:49.410
Okay.

00:08:52.690 --> 00:08:55.050
S-Stretch out
a little farther.

00:08:55.640 --> 00:08:56.360
All right.

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:15.570
Y--You didn't
get hurt, did you?

00:09:16.230 --> 00:09:18.090
N-No.

00:09:28.740 --> 00:09:29.950
The fair's started.

00:09:32.430 --> 00:09:33.130
Here.

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:34.880
Climb on my back.

00:09:35.270 --> 00:09:36.790
I-I couldn't--

00:09:38.440 --> 00:09:39.930
It'll be fine.

00:09:40.490 --> 00:09:42.570
You think so?

00:09:45.550 --> 00:09:46.530
Won't I be too heavy?

00:09:46.760 --> 00:09:47.300
Not at all.

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:52.150
S-So long as it's Kyoko--

00:09:54.270 --> 00:09:55.600
I can reach the top.

00:09:55.790 --> 00:09:57.550
Now what do we do?

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:00.810
I'll--
I'll stand up.

00:10:01.010 --> 00:10:01.930
"Stand up"?

00:10:03.030 --> 00:10:04.590
Just don't lose your grip!

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:11.700
Godai! We're almost there.
Don't give up!

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:19.770
I'm sorry.
Are you okay!?

00:10:26.190 --> 00:10:27.750
Umm--
Godai?

00:10:28.420 --> 00:10:30.360
We're finally alone.

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:37.230
Kyoko, we have no choice but
to wait until help arrives.

00:10:50.050 --> 00:10:51.950
Is it that funny?

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:54.810
Yes! I-I mean, no!
I'm sorry!

00:10:57.020 --> 00:10:57.890
Godai!

00:10:58.650 --> 00:10:59.090
Yot--

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:02.630
Quiet! Against the
wall, quickly!

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:07.060
Now don't move. I'm
trusting my life to you.

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:07.900
Mr. Yotsuya--

00:11:08.660 --> 00:11:12.790
You mustn't mind me.
Please continue your business.

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:17.240
Y-Yotsuya, what
are you doing!?

00:11:17.620 --> 00:11:19.240
Quiet now--

00:11:29.050 --> 00:11:33.990
Autumn festival;
Tonight, my harvest banquet;
A feast for the eyes.

00:11:48.010 --> 00:11:51.690
I owe this all to you.
I'll take my leave.

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:55.670
Mr. Yotsuya--

00:11:56.490 --> 00:11:59.770
Fear not! I'll summon
the troops forthwith.

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:22.150
Here's one! A sucker
ready to scare!

00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:25.190
This is your night!
You're the No. 1 spook!!

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:29.300
I suppose I'll have to look
afraid when I see Ms. Otonashi.

00:12:29.990 --> 00:12:33.220
However, I wouldn't
want to appear cowardly...

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:38.530
...but If I don't appear
scared, she'll be disappointed.

00:12:38.840 --> 00:12:39.640
A dilemma.

00:12:44.610 --> 00:12:48.100
What to do? I should have
thought this over last night.

00:12:49.110 --> 00:12:50.090
What'll I do?

00:12:50.850 --> 00:12:51.820
What'll I do?

00:13:03.940 --> 00:13:07.390
Mr. Yotsuya isn't back yet.
Where could he have gone?

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:13.320
At the time, I was hoping
Yotsuya wouldn't come back--

00:13:15.710 --> 00:13:18.050
Leaving them alone!?
Are you crazy!?

00:13:18.320 --> 00:13:22.070
I was anticipating the
comical possibilities!

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:24.190
How can you
even THINK it!?

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:26.780
I assume tonight's
squid fry is on you?

00:13:26.850 --> 00:13:29.470
This is an emergency,
and you think of FOOD!?

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:32.430
I want a squid fry.
I want a squid fry.

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:34.720
Ms. Otonashi!
Are you all right!?

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:36.820
Coach Mitaka!

00:13:37.070 --> 00:13:38.490
Thank goodness
you're safe!

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:40.490
Godai, where are you?

00:13:43.830 --> 00:13:45.490
Maybe I should go home.

00:13:45.680 --> 00:13:48.000
Don't say that!
You're just gettin' starrted!

00:13:52.320 --> 00:13:53.700
Godai!

00:13:54.420 --> 00:13:56.650
See that!?
See what you did!?

00:13:56.710 --> 00:14:00.520
Your makeup did the trick!
That's what practice is for!

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:04.150
Kuroda! I was good!
Really, really good!

00:14:06.090 --> 00:14:06.890
Take my hand.

00:14:06.960 --> 00:14:07.750
Coach Mitaka!

00:14:08.230 --> 00:14:09.320
I'll lift her up.

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:11.580
Godai? You're here?

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:13.360
I've been
here all along.

00:14:13.570 --> 00:14:17.750
A man who can't rescue a lady
shouldn't be so uppity.

00:14:18.340 --> 00:14:19.460
Here she comes.

00:14:19.680 --> 00:14:20.440
W-Wait!

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:22.170
Don't you
dare touch her!

00:14:22.470 --> 00:14:25.700
What is your problem!?
She can't reach if I don't!

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:29.000
No choice.

00:14:29.190 --> 00:14:32.780
Ms. Otonashi, just endure it.
I'll have you out in a flash!

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:38.060
--Behind you! Behind you!
--Behind me?

00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:40.220
Have you reconsidered
the squid proposition?

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:42.590
It's just Mr. Yotsuya.

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:48.170
Oh, Godai, be a man and
hand over Ms. Otonashi!

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:50.020
C'mon, I can't reach--

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:56.360
--Coach Mitaka.
--Told ya so.

00:14:57.980 --> 00:14:59.970
Mr. Yotsuya, what
is the matter with--

00:15:00.110 --> 00:15:02.840
Have no fear.
I shall return.

00:15:03.520 --> 00:15:04.370
Wait!

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:05.370
Yotsuya--

00:15:08.030 --> 00:15:14.950
A harvest full moon;
Views three players at well's base;
What drama wells up?

00:15:17.860 --> 00:15:19.450
That man is damaged.

00:15:20.170 --> 00:15:24.250
You're the one who's damaged.
Put Ms. Otonashi down!

00:15:25.810 --> 00:15:26.570
Sorry.

00:15:26.810 --> 00:15:27.320
Cretin!

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:39.060
Godai, where are you?

00:15:39.190 --> 00:15:40.450
My dear Kozue.

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:44.710
Be at ease.
It is I.

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:46.020
Mr. Yotsuya?

00:15:46.430 --> 00:15:48.660
I know where Godai is.

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:50.750
Really?

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:53.600
And for true.
Price: one squid fry.

00:15:53.730 --> 00:15:54.290
Okay!

00:15:54.870 --> 00:15:55.530
Much obliged.

00:15:58.070 --> 00:16:00.640
We can't depend on
Mr. Yotsuya for help.

00:16:01.110 --> 00:16:02.470
It seems that way.

00:16:03.050 --> 00:16:07.340
But with the three of us
we could manage to get out.

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:09.840
But how?

00:16:10.520 --> 00:16:11.340
I've got it!

00:16:11.790 --> 00:16:14.570
Were Godai or I to
climb outside the well...

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:17.420
...one could lift and the other
could pull the manager out.

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:19.320
Deal.              Deal.

00:16:20.590 --> 00:16:21.690
Wai't             Wai't
a SeC--            a SeC--

00:16:28.830 --> 00:16:30.530
If I were the one
left in the well...

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:33.400
If he were the one
outside with the manager...

00:16:33.700 --> 00:16:34.960
...he'd leave me behind...

00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:36.590
...and take off...

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:37.400
...with her...

00:16:37.480 --> 00:16:38.070
...alone!

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:44.570
Rock,              Rock
paper--             paper-!-

00:16:47.850 --> 00:16:49.370
Godai!

00:16:50.030 --> 00:16:50.890
Look out--          Kozue--

00:16:51.620 --> 00:16:52.340
I'm falling--

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:53.070
Hold on!

00:16:53.170 --> 00:16:54.250
I can't--

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:55.320
You can do it!

00:16:55.400 --> 00:16:56.250
No, I can't--

00:16:56.330 --> 00:16:59.900
Hold her with your right
shoulder-- Your other right--

00:17:00.140 --> 00:17:01.690
You hold your racket
with your right!

00:17:01.780 --> 00:17:02.900
I don't
PLAY tennis!

00:17:03.310 --> 00:17:04.230
Your left, then!

00:17:04.380 --> 00:17:05.730
Just use my shoulder!

00:17:06.970 --> 00:17:08.670
Okay, now let go.

00:17:12.850 --> 00:17:13.960
That was scary.

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:15.310
You okay?

00:17:15.450 --> 00:17:16.000
Yeah.

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:18.090
Be more careful!

00:17:18.190 --> 00:17:19.540
You could have been hurt.

00:17:19.630 --> 00:17:21.180
Oh no! I forgot
my cookies--

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:22.660
Excuse me--

00:17:23.330 --> 00:17:25.310
It's a little late to
mention this now, but...

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:29.430
it might have been better to
help her up rather than down.

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:39.900
T-That was
F-Frankenstein!

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:41.230
No kiddin'!

00:17:43.380 --> 00:17:46.140
M-Manager!!

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:53.190
That's weird! Can't you sniff
out the manager's smell?

00:17:54.990 --> 00:17:56.120
You're no help!

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:59.120
I-I can't go there!

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:07.560
M-Manager!

00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:11.050
I'll go up first.

00:18:11.300 --> 00:18:14.030
I'm cerrtain that
I should be the one.

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:14.590
No!

00:18:15.850 --> 00:18:17.230
Now, grow up a bit.

00:18:17.510 --> 00:18:18.730
My maturity
isn't in question.

00:18:18.980 --> 00:18:20.610
Why shouldn't I go first?

00:18:21.860 --> 00:18:24.450
For one thing, my
legs are longer.

00:18:25.590 --> 00:18:26.300
It's true!

00:18:26.690 --> 00:18:30.090
Thus, the chance is greater
for me to reach the top.

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:32.280
That's why you should
be supporting me.

00:18:32.560 --> 00:18:34.090
How does that follow!?

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:37.430
Why are they arguing
over who goes first?

00:18:37.640 --> 00:18:38.400
Well--

00:18:40.060 --> 00:18:42.190
Yotsuya!?         Yotsuya!?
When did--        When did--

00:18:42.910 --> 00:18:45.960
When Mitaka said, "For one
thing, my legs are longer."

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:49.950
Our circumstances
have changed.

00:18:50.420 --> 00:18:52.530
Yes, Mr. Yotsuya
should go first.

00:18:53.280 --> 00:18:56.010
Yes, we could never
trust him down here.

00:18:57.120 --> 00:18:57.840
And then--

00:18:58.090 --> 00:19:01.980
Wait a sec. If he goes first,
he'll just leave us again.

00:19:02.430 --> 00:19:04.540
Good point. Better
send me up first--

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:05.860
Back to that!?

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:10.810
Perhaps you could play "rock-
paper-scissors," like before?

00:19:11.610 --> 00:19:13.160
That's right.
We never finished.

00:19:13.440 --> 00:19:14.420
Fine with me.

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:22.460
Rock, paper...

00:19:22.810 --> 00:19:23.500
SCISSORS!

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:24.880
Don't cheat!

00:19:25.190 --> 00:19:25.970
Where's Yotsuya!?

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:29.920
He climbed up
out of the well!

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:32.690
He what!?

00:19:33.750 --> 00:19:34.690
But how!?

00:19:35.050 --> 00:19:38.120
Let's see. He went
like this and...

00:19:38.200 --> 00:19:39.810
...skitta-skitta-skitta
like that.

00:19:41.790 --> 00:19:42.510
It's true!

00:19:48.440 --> 00:19:51.760
That Frankenstein just
gives me the creeps!

00:19:53.680 --> 00:19:55.440
M-Manager!

00:20:02.420 --> 00:20:04.500
We were just here!

00:20:05.450 --> 00:20:07.280
But it won't work!

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:10.450
'Cause I ain't
stickin' around!

00:20:15.700 --> 00:20:17.890
Mitaka, move
over that way!

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:20.730
You can move just
as easily, Godai!

00:20:21.640 --> 00:20:23.630
Excuse me.
I'll go first.

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:24.330
You can't!

00:20:24.610 --> 00:20:25.560
It's too dangerous.

00:20:25.970 --> 00:20:26.600
B-But--

00:20:32.780 --> 00:20:35.620
Okay, Mitaka.
Get on.

00:20:36.160 --> 00:20:36.770
Godai.

00:20:38.430 --> 00:20:39.040
All right.

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:49.650
Made it!!

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:51.360
Right!

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:57.170
Mitaka!
Found you!

00:21:03.210 --> 00:21:05.340
Oh, Mitaka!
Mitaka!

00:21:05.510 --> 00:21:06.560
Get offa me!

00:21:06.650 --> 00:21:08.300
Akemi, you're drunk
again, aren't you!

00:21:10.590 --> 00:21:12.540
You're killing Godai!

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:17.780
Clear a path.

00:21:20.600 --> 00:21:21.890
Hi ya, Manager!

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:23.930
You're Godai's friend--

00:21:23.990 --> 00:21:26.480
C'mon, it's Sakamoto!

00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:29.200
Godai! Godai!

00:21:33.300 --> 00:21:35.170
Godai's dead!!

00:21:40.740 --> 00:21:42.000
I-I'm scared!

00:21:44.010 --> 00:21:46.580
M-Manager!

00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:55.810
W-Where you goin', Soichiro!?
I don't wanna go!!

00:21:55.990 --> 00:21:59.400
Ha Ha! Don't push me into
the manager like that!

00:21:59.460 --> 00:22:00.750
I can't breathe!

00:22:01.770 --> 00:22:02.490
Stop that!

00:22:02.580 --> 00:22:03.440
Just a kissy,
Mitaka!

00:22:03.500 --> 00:22:04.160
Yotsuya!

00:22:05.180 --> 00:22:05.960
What joy!

00:22:08.010 --> 00:22:08.990
You idiot!

00:22:10.770 --> 00:22:12.260
Ma! Ma!

00:22:12.480 --> 00:22:13.420
Ma!

00:22:13.950 --> 00:22:16.180
Ma, ya gotta see!
C'mon!!

00:22:21.130 --> 00:22:22.310
You're drunk, ain'tcha?

00:22:22.400 --> 00:22:23.510
Am not!

00:22:23.750 --> 00:22:25.510
Then blow into
the balloon.

00:22:25.900 --> 00:22:27.830
Aww, shaddup!

00:22:33.000 --> 00:22:34.440
Blow in the
darned balloon!

00:22:40.350 --> 00:22:41.230
Ma, c'mon!

00:22:41.450 --> 00:22:42.270
Give it a rest!

00:22:43.180 --> 00:22:44.640
I quit.

00:22:45.310 --> 00:22:46.700
So I practiced
three months.

00:22:47.240 --> 00:22:48.580
So I made my
own costume.

00:22:48.950 --> 00:22:50.780
I know when I'm beat.

00:22:51.720 --> 00:22:53.350
Hoshikawa?

00:22:56.790 --> 00:22:58.720
What a beautiful
full moon.

00:23:00.220 --> 00:23:01.850
Startin' without me?

00:23:02.060 --> 00:23:04.250
Ma, cut it out.
You're embarrassin' me.

00:23:05.170 --> 00:23:06.050
We're full.

00:23:06.260 --> 00:23:07.360
You can't get in.

00:23:07.970 --> 00:23:11.380
You can't keep me outta
this party. Here I come!

00:23:13.200 --> 00:23:14.670
See. I fit.

00:23:15.080 --> 00:23:16.760
So what do we do next?

00:23:17.920 --> 00:23:19.440
We party!

00:23:19.650 --> 00:23:21.200
Indubitably!

00:23:49.670 --> 00:23:52.800
I know we all have
to part someday.

00:23:53.180 --> 00:23:55.700
But I never thought the
day would actually arrive.

00:23:56.590 --> 00:24:01.350
Next: "What!? Kyoko Married!?
Godai's Tearful Goodbye"

00:24:01.750 --> 00:24:02.470
Godai!

00:24:02.690 --> 00:24:04.920
What do you mean
by "goodbye"?
